+## [v0.1.12-test.1] - 2026-11-25
+
+> Experimental receiver-specific transport hardening; no confirmed E2LB connection fix.
+> 接收端专项传输加固实验，尚未证实 E2LB 连接成功。
+
+### English
+- Limit reliable bursts conservatively on identified E2LB receivers, without changing the advertised negotiation values.
+- Permit at most two rate-limited replies to consecutive startup DETECT markers while the observed startup packet is unconfirmed; no SYN or authentication replay.
+- Validate restart SYN structure, bound control queues and retire pending controls on transport close.
+
+### 简体中文
+- E2LB 专项保守限流，不改变协商声明值。
+- 启动消息未确认时，连续 DETECT 最多限频应答两次；不主动重发 SYN 或认证消息。
+- 校验重协商 SYN 结构，限制控制队列容量，关闭链路时清理积压控制消息。
 
